#: extension/gnome-shell-cast@oxygenws.com/schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.gnome-shell-cast.gschema.xml:16
msgid ""
"Scale the captured video down to this size before encoding. \"auto\" lets "
"the receiver's own limits decide, which is what Chrome does. Above 1080p, "
"raise the bitrate to match and expect a hardware encoder to be needed for a "
"smooth stream."
msgstr ""
"Perkecil video yang ditangkap ke ukuran ini sebelum dikodekan. “auto” "
"membiarkan batas penerima sendiri yang menentukan, seperti yang dilakukan "
"Chrome. Di atas 1080p, naikkan bitrate yang sepadan dan perkirakan perlunya "
"enkoder perangkat keras agar aliran mulus."

#: extension/gnome-shell-cast@oxygenws.com/schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.gnome-shell-cast.gschema.xml:21
msgid "Stream framerate"
msgstr "Laju bingkai aliran"

#: extension/gnome-shell-cast@oxygenws.com/schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.gnome-shell-cast.gschema.xml:22
msgid "Frames per second, or 0 to let the receiver's limits decide."
msgstr "Bingkai per detik, atau 0 agar batas penerima yang menentukan."

#: extension/gnome-shell-cast@oxygenws.com/schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.gnome-shell-cast.gschema.xml:27
msgid "Video bitrate in kbit/s"
msgstr "Bitrate video dalam kbit/s"

#: extension/gnome-shell-cast@oxygenws.com/schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.gnome-shell-cast.gschema.xml:28
msgid ""
"Roughly 4000 for 720p, 8000 for 1080p, 16000 for 1440p and 30000 for 4K; "
"more for fast-moving content. 0 lets the receiver's limits decide."
msgstr ""
"Kira-kira 4000 untuk 720p, 8000 untuk 1080p, 16000 untuk 1440p dan 30000 "
"untuk 4K; lebih tinggi untuk konten yang bergerak cepat. 0 membiarkan batas "
"penerima yang menentukan."

#: extension/gnome-shell-cast@oxygenws.com/schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.gnome-shell-cast.gschema.xml:33
msgid "Audio bitrate in kbit/s"
msgstr "Bitrate audio dalam kbit/s"

#: extension/gnome-shell-cast@oxygenws.com/schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.gnome-shell-cast.gschema.xml:34
msgid ""
"Opus bitrate for the cast audio, or 0 to let the receiver's limits decide."
msgstr ""
"Bitrate Opus untuk audio yang disiarkan, atau 0 agar batas penerima yang "
"menentukan."

#: extension/gnome-shell-cast@oxygenws.com/schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.gnome-shell-cast.gschema.xml:47
msgid ""
"Which encoder to use. \"auto\" prefers hardware (VA-API, NVENC, V4L2) and "
"falls back to software. Choose software when a graphics driver produces a "
"broken or stuttering picture. \"vaapi\" (Intel, AMD), \"nvenc\" (NVIDIA) and "
"\"v4l2\" (Arm boards) pin one hardware API. Casting fails with a message if "
"the choice cannot be met."
msgstr ""
"Enkoder yang dipakai. “auto” mengutamakan perangkat keras (VA-API, NVENC, "
"V4L2) dan kembali ke perangkat lunak. Pilih perangkat lunak bila penggerak "
"grafis menghasilkan gambar rusak atau tersendat. “vaapi” (Intel, AMD), "
"“nvenc” (NVIDIA), dan “v4l2” (papan Arm) mengunci satu antarmuka perangkat "
"keras; cast gagal dengan sebuah pesan bila pilihan tak dapat dipenuhi."

#: extension/gnome-shell-cast@oxygenws.com/schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.gnome-shell-cast.gschema.xml:57
msgid ""
"The raw video format handed to the encoder. \"auto\" offers both and lets "
"negotiation pick whichever the chosen encoder accepts. Forcing a format "
"restricts casting to encoders that accept it, which on most systems means "
"forcing the encoder type too."
msgstr ""
"Format video mentah yang diberikan ke enkoder. “auto” menawarkan keduanya "
"dan membiarkan negosiasi memilih mana yang diterima enkoder terpilih. "
"Memaksa suatu format membatasi penyiaran ke enkoder yang menerimanya, yang "
"di sebagian besar sistem berarti memaksa jenis enkoder juga."

#: extension/gnome-shell-cast@oxygenws.com/schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.gnome-shell-cast.gschema.xml:65
msgid "What casting the screen sends"
msgstr "Apa yang dikirim saat men-cast layar"

#: extension/gnome-shell-cast@oxygenws.com/schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.gnome-shell-cast.gschema.xml:66
msgid ""
"Either a mirror of a display you already have, or a new monitor created for "
"the cast and removed when it ends. A new monitor needs a Wayland session."
msgstr "Kembaran layar yang sudah Anda miliki, atau layar baru yang dibuat untuk cast dan dihapus saat cast berakhir. Layar baru memerlukan sesi Wayland."

#: extension/gnome-shell-cast@oxygenws.com/schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.gnome-shell-cast.gschema.xml:80
msgid ""
"Where to show the cast indicator: the top-bar tray, or the quick settings "
"menu."
msgstr ""
"Tempat menampilkan ikon cast: baki bar atas, atau menu pengaturan cepat."

